(card "exp:F-R2-1_vpin_drop_q80_300s" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:F-R2-1_vpin_drop_q80_300s"
  :body "---\nnav: 25\ntype: experiment\nid: F-R2-1_vpin_drop_q80_300s\nshort_name: vpin_drop_q80_300s\ntitle: \"F-R2-1 — anchor + drop VPIN@300s trailing-cum q80+\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: f\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_f__microstructure]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.9565\ntrain_trade_count: 111\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8649\ntrain_sharpe: 7.9267\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0509\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0669\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.1903\ntest_trade_count: 18\ntest_sharpe: 6.3832\ntest_win_rate: 0.7222\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0053\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/f, round/r2, axis/microstructure, axis/blacklist, status/falsified, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# F-R2-1 — anchor + drop VPIN@300s q80+\n\n> **TL;DR** —— F 队 R2 swap signal: 把 OFI 换成 **VPIN@300s window**，drop 高 q80+ trade（vs F-R1-1 用 OFI q90）。train 1.96 < anchor 2.19, test 1.19 < anchor 1.25 —— **微结构 axis 整体 falsified**。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：VPIN 比 OFI 更能反映 informed flow → 砍 high-VPIN trade 应当效果更好。\n- 实测：与 F-R1-1 同 fate, test 略差 (1.19 vs 1.25 anchor)。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`team_f/scripts/round_2_runner.py`\n- 步骤：anchor default-admit → drop legs with VPIN@300s ≥ trailing-cum q80; warmup 10.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- trailing-cum quantile strict past-only (edge-leak fix from F-R1-1 sticks). `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.9565 | 111 | 7.93 | 86.5% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0509 ± 0.067 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.1903 | 18 | 6.38 | 72.2% | -0.53% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.058 (FAIL)** | -2 | -0.77 | -2.8pp | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; train 已 < anchor → 直接 fail。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_axis_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R1-1__ofi_drop_extreme]] (signal swap OFI→VPIN)\n- **descendants**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-2__vpin_drop_q70_300s]], [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-3__vpin_drop_q80_600s]], [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-4__ofi_dir_align]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_f/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (F-R2-1)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (F-R2-1 test_nav 1.19)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- VPIN 与 OFI 同 fate confirm microstructure-as-blacklist 整条 lineage 死亡。下次微结构 idea 必须接进 sizing layer，不是 binary admit/drop。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-1__vpin_drop_q80_300s.md"
